    },
    {
      "number": "777",
      "text": "777. 哪个数大：\n1) 是$\\frac{7}{12}$还是$\\frac{29}{48}$；\n2) 是$\\frac{13}{18}$还是$\\frac{11}{15}$？",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "778",
      "text": "778. 证明下列不等式：\n1) $\\frac{123}{800}>\\frac{1}{8}$；\n2) $\\frac{361}{6000}<\\frac{1}{15}$.",
